    return 'This route is protected by the block.unlisted.ips middleware.';
})->middleware('block.unlisted.ips');
```

Now, when a user tries to access any of the protected routes, they will be blocked if their IP address is not in the allowed list defined in the middleware. If the user's IP is allowed, they will be able to access the route normally.

